Package: mithrandir
Version: 0.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Antonio <antonio@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, dconf-gsettings-backend | gsettings-backend
Recommends: papirus-icon-theme, clamav, clamav-freshclam, clamav-daemon
Homepage: https://github.com/Antux912012/mithrandir
Description: Modern GNU/Linux System Cleaner, Maintenance, and AI Diagnostics
 Mithrandir is an intuitive, Libadwaita-based GNU/Linux maintenance utility.
 It provides deep system cleaning (caches, logs, unneeded packages, Flatpaks, Snaps),
 realtime hardware and temperature sensor monitoring, systemd service management,
 malware and ransomware detection with ClamAV, and AI-assisted troubleshooting.
